        retval = UA_STATUSCODE_BADCOMMUNICATIONERROR;
    else
        retval = processOPN(server, connection, channelId, &msg);
    break;
```

The connection state starts as ESTABLISHED (from the dummy connection), so we can go straight to OPN. The channel state is FRESH (from SecureChannel init), which means the first OPN creates a new channel.

